hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15542","Abd al-Razzaq narrated to us, he said: Mamar informed us, from Ayyub, from Nafi, from Ayyash ibn Abi Rabiah, he said: I heard the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) saying: A wind will come forth before the Hour, in which the souls of every believer will be taken."
